It's very safe.

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:13.810
You just, I mean, if you're a type six,

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:16.888
you're like I'm not going
to get a sharp travel mug.

00:16:16.888 --> 00:16:21.467
No, it's like it pops open in a way that,

00:16:21.467 --> 00:16:25.510
it's perfectly designed
so that you can drink it

00:16:25.510 --> 00:16:28.870
and then seal it up
without having to touch any

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:32.460
of the stuff that you don't
