01:14:08.650 --> 01:14:11.860
But there are different triads, right?

01:14:11.860 --> 01:14:14.100
There's nine total numbers,

01:14:14.100 --> 01:14:16.180
and so there's three, three, and three.

01:14:16.180 --> 01:14:19.853
There's a triad called the feeling triad.

01:14:20.930 --> 01:14:22.770
This is called the heart center.

01:14:22.770 --> 01:14:25.298
These are the people who
are most in their heart

01:14:25.298 --> 01:14:28.518
and have the most feelings.

01:14:28.518 --> 01:14:33.110
Three is right in the
middle of the feeling triad.

01:14:33.110 --> 01:14:34.423
You're like, what?

01:14:35.950 --> 01:14:36.900
That doesn't make any sense.

01:14:36.900 --> 01:14:39.130
You don't seem like you are,
you don't feel that much.

01:14:39.130 --> 01:14:41.060
You don't seem very sensitive.

01:14:41.060 --> 01:14:44.650
Well, threes are not
known as feeling people.

01:14:44.650 --> 01:14:47.610
Rather they are people of
action and achievement.

01:14:47.610 --> 01:14:51.130
We've actually put our feelings in a box

01:14:51.130 --> 01:14:54.024
so that we can get ahead with
whatever we want to achieve.

01:14:54.024 --> 01:14:58.400
We believe that emotions get
in the way of our performance

01:14:58.400 --> 01:15:01.540
so we substitute thinking and
practical action for feelings.

01:15:01.540 --> 01:15:03.370
But let me tell you,

01:15:03.370 --> 01:15:08.370
we have a lot of feelings and
this is why I am in therapy.

01:15:09.560 --> 01:15:10.470
Okay?

01:15:10.470 --> 01:15:15.470
Because I am naturally very sensitive

01:15:18.100 --> 01:15:22.440
and feeling things deeply all the time.

01:15:22.440 --> 01:15:26.600
But those feelings seem so impractical.

01:15:26.600 --> 01:15:28.590
They seem, they're not pragmatic at all.

01:15:28.590 --> 01:15:33.340
How is a feeling going
to help me do something?

01:15:33.340 --> 01:15:38.340
So we become masters at
putting a dam up between us

01:15:39.040 --> 01:15:40.130
